Package: docketscape
Type: Package
Title: Legal Network and Congestion-Aware Delay Modeling for Court Dockets
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Shraddha", "Ajit", email = "shra19076@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("DK", "Janani", email = "janani007dk@gmail.com", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Splits court delay into two parts: (1) what a case is, represented
    through the statutory Acts and Sections invoked by the case, and (2) where
    it sits, represented by time-varying court docket load. Builds a weighted
    similarity graph of cases from legal provisions using 'igraph' and 'Matrix',
    estimates censoring-aware expected resolution timelines using legally
    similar neighbours, calculates relative lateness, and models delay in
    relation to filing-time court docket load using 'survival'. Designed for
    case-level judicial records such as the Development Data Lab (DDL) extract
    of Indian lower courts (<https://www.devdatalab.org/judicial-data>). Observational
    and non-causal; does not rank judges, evaluate judicial performance, or claim
    causal delay effects.
